WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED
NOTE Track: 1-01 - The Hollow Square (Live)
NOTE Artist: Fractured Prisms
NOTE Album: 1985: Live at Independence Stadium

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.000
(Recorded Live at Independence Stadium, August 15, 1985)

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Step through the iron gates into the fog

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Turn back the pages of the catalog

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:54.000
A hundred years vanish in a single breath

00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:00.000
A sanctuary built beyond the reach of death

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:06.000
Four walls of stone around a quiet court

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Our fragile fortress and our last resort

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Can you hear the flute across the courtyard rain?

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:26.000
Calling every lost soul home again!

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:34.000
Welcome to the Hollow Square!

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:40.000
All six of us are waiting there!

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:46.000
Where the gaslamps burn against the night!

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:52.000
And the prism bends the broken light!

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:58.000
Hold the line, don't let the century in!

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:05.000
This is where our forever begins!

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:32.000
From Romford rails to a Maryland hill

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:38.000
We carried the instruments, we kept them still

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:44.000
Every synth line wired to a memory

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:50.000
In the heart of eighteen eighty-three

00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:56.000
Here on this stage under the stadium sky

00:02:56.000 --> 00:03:03.000
We let the ghosts of the manor fly!

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:51.000
Sing it with us now across the dark!

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:57.000
Every voice a living spark!

00:03:57.000 --> 00:04:04.000
We didn't cross an ocean! We crossed a century!

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:12.000
Welcome to the Hollow Square!

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:18.000
All six of us are waiting there!

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:24.000
Where the gaslamps burn against the night!

00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:30.000
And the prism bends the broken light!

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:37.000
Hold the line, don't let the century in!

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:45.000
This is where our forever begins!

00:04:46.000 --> 00:05:18.000
Inside the Hollow Square... thank you, goodnight!

